WEBVTT

00:07.722 --> 00:13.482
Let's laugh and cry.
chanto waraimasho, nakimasho

00:13.982 --> 00:19.612
We need to fill up our hearts.
kokoro no nakami wo juujitsu sasenakuccha

00:19.612 --> 00:28.162
Making matching memories with you...
anata to osoroi no omoide tsukuruno ga

00:28.162 --> 00:30.032
...is important.
daiji daiji

00:31.412 --> 00:33.962
Sometimes I become...
sunao ni narenakattari

00:34.292 --> 00:37.792
...almost dishonest and mean
ijiwaru shichaisouna hi aruno

00:39.292 --> 00:40.632
That's because...
sore wa...

00:42.632 --> 00:45.382
I love you and adore you,
daisuki de taisetsu de

00:45.512 --> 00:48.722
and I don't want to be apart from you.
hanaretaku nai sei nano nante

00:50.682 --> 00:51.682
That's the truth.
henne

00:54.232 --> 01:00.942
I just want to cuddle...
hontou wa itsumo nuku nuku shitetai

01:01.272 --> 01:03.282
...with you.
futaride

01:04.282 --> 01:09.992
So let's laugh and cry.
dakara waraimashou, nakimashou

01:10.662 --> 01:16.082
We need to keep our hearts warm.
kokoro no ondo wo atatame awanakucha

01:16.292 --> 01:24.592
The fate that made us meet...
anata to deaeta unmei ho subetega

01:24.592 --> 01:26.422
...is important.
daiji daiji

01:32.582 --> 01:36.422
Two princesses live in a castle.

01:37.002 --> 01:41.882
They are enjoying some umeboshi on a bridge over a small pond.

01:44.092 --> 01:45.722
Sour!

02:01.532 --> 02:03.952
Oh? Oh? Oh?

02:03.952 --> 02:07.072
There are now three princesses.

02:07.662 --> 02:12.122
The Precious Place

02:20.592 --> 02:22.802
Who is this?

02:22.802 --> 02:24.472
Seriously?

02:24.472 --> 02:28.262
Nanako-chan, his name is Shiratori-kun.

02:29.102 --> 02:30.772
Shiratori-kun.

02:30.772 --> 02:31.772
Yup.

02:31.772 --> 02:35.312
He just started living here.

02:35.312 --> 02:37.102
So be good to him...

02:38.482 --> 02:39.482
Oh?

02:40.942 --> 02:43.362
Sheesh, look at her eyes.

02:43.822 --> 02:47.412
Looks like she's quite interested in Shiratori-kun.

02:48.452 --> 02:49.702
Yeah.

02:49.702 --> 02:51.792
Yeah, makes me jealous.

02:51.792 --> 02:55.712
Looks like we can't have the welcome party right now.

02:56.172 --> 02:59.042
What's wrong, everyone?

03:15.022 --> 03:16.312
Oh well.

03:16.312 --> 03:20.112
Sorry, but we'll leave Nanako-chan with you, Shiratori-kun.

03:20.732 --> 03:22.532
Why me?

03:23.442 --> 03:25.362
Why?

03:25.362 --> 03:28.112
We're busy.

03:28.112 --> 03:29.282
Yes.

03:29.282 --> 03:33.912
Besides, she's completely focused on you.

03:34.412 --> 03:35.962
No way!

03:35.962 --> 03:39.422
I still have to work on school stuff, too!

03:39.632 --> 03:42.132
Please take good care of her.

03:44.342 --> 03:48.762
Well, good luck until Nanako-chan becomes shiny.

03:49.182 --> 03:50.552
Shiny?

03:51.852 --> 03:53.312
Shiny...

03:53.312 --> 03:55.352
Yup. Shiny.

04:03.612 --> 04:04.652
Hello!

04:04.652 --> 04:06.402
This is Kojima Parcel!

04:06.402 --> 04:10.452
Shiratori Ryushi-san, we're here to deliver your goods!

04:11.702 --> 04:13.282
Thank you very much!

04:13.282 --> 04:14.452
You too.

04:17.252 --> 04:18.002
OK!

04:25.422 --> 04:26.132
These are...

04:29.842 --> 04:31.842
I guess this should do it.

04:32.682 --> 04:36.642
With stuff in it, the room really looks like my room.

04:36.972 --> 04:40.692
Now, I'd better finish up my schoolwork.

04:40.692 --> 04:43.442
I can finish cleaning the room after that.

04:49.402 --> 04:51.452
M-Miss Landlady?

04:52.662 --> 04:55.532
What are you doing, Miss Landlady?

04:55.912 --> 04:57.542
Miss Landlady!

05:02.422 --> 05:04.292
That's you.

05:07.212 --> 05:08.462
No.

05:08.462 --> 05:10.172
I'm Nanako.

05:11.682 --> 05:14.472
Nanako is Nanako, so I'm Nanako.

05:14.472 --> 05:19.642
So if Nanako isn't Nanako, Nanako wouldn't be Nanako, and would be Nanako...

05:20.562 --> 05:21.192
Oh?

05:21.642 --> 05:26.652
Maybe she really turned into a six-year-old like Momono-san said.

05:27.902 --> 05:30.702
Anyway, how would she become shiny?

05:31.202 --> 05:34.952
Anyway, what's shiny?

05:34.952 --> 05:35.992
Onii-chan,

05:36.492 --> 05:40.002
can you read me a story?

05:41.122 --> 05:43.462
Read this story.

05:43.462 --> 05:48.552
Oh, but I have things to do.

05:48.552 --> 05:50.132
Story!

05:50.132 --> 05:53.762
I just can't do it right now.

05:53.762 --> 05:55.142
Maybe later.

05:55.142 --> 05:56.012
OK?

05:57.642 --> 05:59.642
Story!

06:04.812 --> 06:07.942
Right then, a gust of wind blew.

06:07.942 --> 06:10.902
"Everyone, fly with this wind,

06:10.902 --> 06:12.742
to a faraway place,"

06:12.742 --> 06:14.532
the mother said.

06:14.862 --> 06:19.202
Hearing that Roy and others started flying all at once.

06:19.202 --> 06:21.792
"Wow, it's really breezy and feels good."

06:21.792 --> 06:23.122
I don't have time to be doing this.
"Wow, it's really breezy and feels good."

06:23.122 --> 06:25.372
And so, Roy flew away from his mother.
I don't have time to be doing this.

06:25.372 --> 06:26.582
And so, Roy flew away from his mother.

06:26.582 --> 06:28.212
I'd better finish this quickly, and get to my homework.
And so, Roy flew away from his mother.

06:28.212 --> 06:30.382
Soon enough, he couldn't see his mother anymore.
I'd better finish this quickly, and get to my homework.

06:30.382 --> 06:33.302
Soon enough, he couldn't see his mother anymore.

06:35.802 --> 06:39.642
Miss Landlady!

06:41.392 --> 06:42.812
What's wrong, Onii-chan?

06:43.602 --> 06:45.142
What about the story?

06:45.142 --> 06:47.812
Can you read more?

06:48.942 --> 06:50.982
This is not good!

06:51.072 --> 06:53.652
Roy's journey continues.

06:53.822 --> 06:58.662
All of his brothers and sisters found their own spot,

06:58.662 --> 07:00.662
and landed on the ground.

07:00.912 --> 07:05.042
Now, Roy is the only one who is still flying.

07:07.002 --> 07:09.132
Roy is not lonely anymore.

07:09.132 --> 07:11.092
He has all of his friends around him.

07:11.092 --> 07:13.512
That's how Roy's journey ended,

07:13.512 --> 07:14.472
and they lived happily ever after.

07:14.472 --> 07:14.972
The end!

07:20.052 --> 07:22.522
It's finally over.

07:22.522 --> 07:26.852
The time in which I was in both heaven and hell.

07:26.852 --> 07:27.812
Onii-chan.

07:28.522 --> 07:30.482
Thank you, Onii-chan.

07:30.822 --> 07:33.032
You're welcome.

07:34.652 --> 07:37.152
Now I can work on my school stuff!

07:50.672 --> 07:53.632
Onii-chan, do you like drawing?

07:55.092 --> 07:56.672
Well, yeah.

07:57.842 --> 08:01.052
I love to draw too!

08:01.052 --> 08:02.392
Just like you!

08:04.102 --> 08:05.352
Good.

08:07.852 --> 08:10.562
Let's draw together.

08:16.742 --> 08:22.162
She may be young, but maybe she's a good kid.

08:22.162 --> 08:26.082
Maybe she's better than Saki-chan from yesterday.

08:32.752 --> 08:35.092
You shouldn't be drawing here.

08:36.422 --> 08:37.922
You know that!

08:40.182 --> 08:42.052
Are you angry, Onii-chan?

08:45.642 --> 08:48.272
Not at all.

08:48.272 --> 08:48.772
See?

08:49.142 --> 08:50.352
Really?

08:51.352 --> 08:52.902
Really really.

08:54.322 --> 08:55.272
That's good.

08:56.942 --> 08:59.282
This is going to be tough.

08:59.282 --> 09:00.662
Like this?

09:06.582 --> 09:08.292
Hey!

09:08.292 --> 09:09.462
Hey, that's!

09:13.672 --> 09:15.292
Watch out!

09:20.302 --> 09:21.682
Oohâ™¥

09:34.152 --> 09:35.062
Here you go.

09:51.332 --> 09:52.752
Bathroom.

10:10.392 --> 10:12.182
Onii-chan...

10:12.182 --> 10:14.692
Mens

10:24.532 --> 10:27.122
She's not a bad kid,

10:27.122 --> 10:29.412
but she does wear me out.

10:33.752 --> 10:37.342
They're all Miss Landlady.

10:37.342 --> 10:38.132
But...

10:41.382 --> 10:43.472
Onii-chan, I found you!

10:48.972 --> 10:50.222
Nanako-chan?

11:04.532 --> 11:07.992
Because you disappeared.

11:07.992 --> 11:10.912
I don't like being alone.

11:10.912 --> 11:13.122
I'm not going anywhere.

11:13.122 --> 11:14.662
So don't worry.

11:17.122 --> 11:18.292
Hate me?

11:19.632 --> 11:22.592
Do you hate me?

11:23.882 --> 11:26.762
Do you like me?

11:26.762 --> 11:29.512
Well, of course.

11:32.352 --> 11:33.432
Really?

11:33.432 --> 11:35.772
Good!

11:35.772 --> 11:37.692
She's shiny.

11:37.692 --> 11:39.022
I see!

11:39.022 --> 11:41.652
This is the "shiny" that Momono-san was talking about!

11:42.072 --> 11:45.402
I like you a lot too!

11:47.662 --> 11:51.872
Maybe it's the first time that a girl has told me that she likes me.

11:51.872 --> 11:54.412
I also like the cat.

11:56.622 --> 12:02.382
Also Momo-chan, Tama-chan, Asa-chan and Sayo-chan.

12:02.382 --> 12:03.962
Oh, and Johnny-chan!

12:05.972 --> 12:08.882
I love them all!

12:10.802 --> 12:11.972
What's wrong?

12:12.722 --> 12:14.522
Nothing is wrong.

12:15.602 --> 12:16.772
Oh, yes.

12:17.392 --> 12:20.812
I have some important work to do.

12:20.812 --> 12:23.652
Can you be a good girl and be quiet for a while?

12:24.982 --> 12:25.692
Yeah!

12:25.692 --> 12:28.112
I'm a good girl, so I'll be quiet.

12:39.832 --> 12:42.502
She is quiet...

12:42.502 --> 12:45.302
...but it's not easy being stared at.

12:56.562 --> 12:59.772
Hey, Nanako-chan, it's heavy, so can you...

13:01.522 --> 13:03.152
Nanako-chan...

13:07.822 --> 13:09.322
Onii-chan...

13:13.662 --> 13:19.332
Miss Landlady has really transformed into Nanako-chan, six years old.

13:25.252 --> 13:27.592
Hi, Shiratori-kun!

13:27.592 --> 13:29.132
How's it going!?

13:29.762 --> 13:31.092
Um...

13:31.342 --> 13:36.142
My, we've walked in on quite a scene.

13:36.142 --> 13:38.892
Young people these days are so...

13:38.892 --> 13:40.352
Onii-chan...

13:40.352 --> 13:41.482
So quick.

13:41.482 --> 13:43.442
What are you talking about?

13:43.442 --> 13:44.942
You're mistaken about this!

13:46.232 --> 13:50.612
Shiratori-san, you're so quick to act.

13:50.612 --> 13:53.072
I told you, you're wrong.

13:53.072 --> 13:54.702
Either way,

13:55.912 --> 13:57.412
she's so lovely!

13:59.622 --> 14:01.372
What are you taking pictures of!?

14:01.372 --> 14:03.542
Those are just memorial shots.

14:03.542 --> 14:06.542
Memory of what!?

14:09.882 --> 14:11.802
Where am I?

14:12.342 --> 14:15.182
This is Shiratori-kun's room.

14:15.892 --> 14:20.062
Why was I sleeping in Shiratori-san's room?

14:21.432 --> 14:24.352
You mean you don't have Nanako-chan's...

14:25.062 --> 14:30.322
Maybe you got tired while helping unload Shiratori-kun's stuff and fell asleep?

14:33.402 --> 14:37.162
Now that you mention it, I think that's what happened.

14:38.582 --> 14:43.252
Shiratori-san, I'm sorry for falling asleep.

14:43.252 --> 14:44.502
It's okay!

14:44.502 --> 14:47.172
He doesn't mind at all!

14:48.382 --> 14:53.262
Kozue-chan never has any memories from when she transforms into other girls.

14:54.182 --> 14:57.852
Instead, we fill her mind with some other memories.

14:57.852 --> 15:03.182
We fill in the gaps from when she was transformed with made-up memories.

15:03.182 --> 15:08.062
That's why she never realizes that she transforms into other girls.

15:08.982 --> 15:13.072
Um, what are you two talking about?

15:13.072 --> 15:14.822
Isn't it obvious?

15:14.822 --> 15:17.952
About Shiratori-kun's welcome party!

15:18.452 --> 15:21.202
Momono-san, we're ready!

15:24.042 --> 15:26.122
Welcome!! to Narutakisou, Shiratori-kun

15:27.672 --> 15:30.592
A welcome party for Shiratori-san!

15:30.592 --> 15:32.252
That's right.

15:32.252 --> 15:35.682
You should attend too, Kozue-chan.

15:35.682 --> 15:36.682
Yes.

15:36.682 --> 15:38.642
If it's okay with Shiratori-san, sure!

15:40.102 --> 15:42.392
I'd be thrilled.

15:42.392 --> 15:45.142
I guess I'll just stay up all night to work on school stuff.

15:45.642 --> 15:50.362
Now, now, a welcome party needs to start with self-introductions!

15:50.362 --> 15:52.402
Let me start, then!

15:53.362 --> 15:55.322
I'm Momono Megumi of apartment 3.

15:55.322 --> 15:57.112
20 years old. A college student.

15:57.112 --> 16:01.032
Well, I expect you to learn more about me as time goes on.

16:01.032 --> 16:02.662
OK, next, Tama-chan!

16:03.202 --> 16:04.912
Yes.

16:05.712 --> 16:08.922
I'm Chanohata Tamami, living in apartment 1.

16:08.922 --> 16:12.462
I'm a high school junior, 16 years old.

16:12.462 --> 16:16.672
I go to the same school as Kozue-chan.

16:17.342 --> 16:19.552
I see.

16:19.552 --> 16:22.892
Yes. We always go to school together.

16:22.892 --> 16:24.142
Yes.

16:24.142 --> 16:26.932
We've been friends for a long time.

16:26.932 --> 16:27.772
Right?

16:28.142 --> 16:31.402
Hmm, she does have a cute side.

16:31.402 --> 16:32.772
See?

16:34.782 --> 16:39.322
So, I'm very pleased to meet you.

16:40.242 --> 16:41.322
Yes...

16:41.322 --> 16:43.412
So, next, Sayo-chan!

16:43.412 --> 16:44.412
Go!

16:45.372 --> 16:46.412
Yes.

16:47.202 --> 16:50.882
Apartment 5, Kurosaki Sayoko.

16:50.882 --> 16:52.292
A job-hopper.

16:52.292 --> 16:54.252
Age is a secret.

16:54.252 --> 16:55.172
No hobby.

16:56.632 --> 16:59.052
She's kind of a dark person.

16:59.052 --> 17:01.222
I'm sorry, Shiratori Onii-chan.

17:01.222 --> 17:03.642
Mom doesn't like things like this.

17:03.642 --> 17:04.432
Mom?

17:04.432 --> 17:08.432
Sayoko-san is Asami-chan's mother.

17:08.432 --> 17:10.392
I see.

17:11.192 --> 17:14.022
Sayoko-san is...

17:14.022 --> 17:14.942
...quiet,

17:14.942 --> 17:15.982
unsociable,

17:15.982 --> 17:16.902
unenergetic,

17:16.902 --> 17:17.652
klutzy,

17:17.652 --> 17:19.242
disorganized...

17:19.242 --> 17:23.912
Simply put, she's a typical good-for-nothing.

17:25.492 --> 17:26.492
Oh, I see.

17:26.492 --> 17:30.122
Things are going so well, so Asami-chan, your turn!

17:30.122 --> 17:31.542
Yes!

17:32.582 --> 17:36.462
Kurosaki Asami, 1st year junior high, 12 years old.

17:36.462 --> 17:39.802
I live in apartment 5 with Mom.

17:39.802 --> 17:44.432
Mom and I are very pleased to meet you, Shiratori Onii-chan.

17:44.432 --> 17:46.222
Yes, me too.

17:46.222 --> 17:47.932
She looks like a bright girl.

17:48.022 --> 17:50.642
My hobby is cooking,

17:50.642 --> 17:54.112
but I'm not very good.

17:54.112 --> 17:57.652
So I'm learning from Kozue Onee-chan.

17:57.652 --> 18:00.442
Her cooking is so good!

18:00.822 --> 18:02.782
Not that good.

18:02.782 --> 18:04.572
You are good too.

18:04.572 --> 18:07.122
Really, Kozue Onee-chan?

18:07.122 --> 18:08.542
Really.

18:09.292 --> 18:12.462
Also, I like cardboard boxes.

18:12.462 --> 18:14.502
Huh? Cardboard?

18:16.962 --> 18:18.382
Don't take it, Mom!

18:18.382 --> 18:20.972
That's Onii-chan's!

18:24.012 --> 18:25.392
Why?

18:25.392 --> 18:30.682
Next, the only man of Narutakisou, Haibara-san, a.k.a. Bara-san!

18:30.682 --> 18:31.392
Hey!

18:32.182 --> 18:34.192
I'm Johnny of apartment 6.

18:34.192 --> 18:35.352
Shooting star Johnny.

18:35.352 --> 18:36.312
Nice to meet you.

18:36.312 --> 18:39.652
This is Haibara Yukio, my servant.

18:39.902 --> 18:42.702
A ventriloquist?

18:42.702 --> 18:43.862
Shut up!

18:43.862 --> 18:45.072
I'm the main man.

18:45.072 --> 18:46.242
He's just an extra.

18:46.242 --> 18:47.952
And his occupation is...

18:47.952 --> 18:51.202
Now that most everyone has finished...

18:52.462 --> 18:53.622
Oh, that's it?

18:53.622 --> 18:54.832
The only one left is Kozue-chan!

18:55.882 --> 18:59.002
Finish this round off clean!

18:59.002 --> 18:59.842
Yes.

19:01.672 --> 19:03.592
Um...

19:03.592 --> 19:06.552
I'm the landlady, Aoba Kozue.

19:08.262 --> 19:09.812
I...

19:17.272 --> 19:21.402
I love Narutakisou.

19:21.982 --> 19:25.912
It's more than just having lived here for a long time,

19:25.912 --> 19:29.242
or that this place is filled with my memories.

19:29.242 --> 19:31.452
More than that,

19:31.452 --> 19:33.252
I love the things that belong here,

19:33.252 --> 19:34.752
the people who live here,

19:34.752 --> 19:36.832
all the encounters I've had,

19:36.832 --> 19:38.542
I love them all.

19:39.212 --> 19:41.672
I love them all!

19:42.922 --> 19:48.012
As the landlady of Narutakisou,

19:48.012 --> 19:53.222
I will try my best to make this just as precious of a place for you too.

19:53.932 --> 19:59.192
So, Shiratori-san, I'm very pleased to meet you.

20:00.692 --> 20:02.192
Me too.

20:02.822 --> 20:04.572
That was good.

20:04.572 --> 20:08.282
It didn't exactly sound like a self introduction, but you pass.

20:10.372 --> 20:15.792
This really is a precious place for Miss Landlady.

20:15.792 --> 20:18.922
Now, it's finally the main man's turn!

20:18.922 --> 20:19.882
Shiratori-kun!

20:20.212 --> 20:21.502
Yes.

20:21.502 --> 20:23.962
I'm Shiratori Ryoshi, 18 years old.

20:23.962 --> 20:26.382
I'm going to vocational school starting this spring.

20:26.802 --> 20:28.592
My hobby is drawing.

20:28.592 --> 20:31.762
It's my first time living independently, so I'm quite unknowledgeable.

20:32.102 --> 20:35.102
So I'd be grateful if you can show me around.

20:35.102 --> 20:37.102
I'm please to meet you.

20:37.392 --> 20:38.852
Welcome!

20:40.102 --> 20:41.612
Welcome.

20:50.362 --> 20:53.782
Mom, that's Onii-chan's cardboard box!

20:55.372 --> 20:56.502
Are you alive?

20:59.042 --> 21:00.752
That was close.

21:05.672 --> 21:06.922
Miss Landlady!

21:17.392 --> 21:18.852
M-Miss Landlady?

21:20.562 --> 21:22.732
Oh, it's Shiratori.

21:23.772 --> 21:26.232
Could it be... Saki-chan?

21:27.442 --> 21:31.112
What? You don't want me?

21:31.662 --> 21:34.742
Oh? A welcome party for Shiratori?

21:34.742 --> 21:38.162
Good! We'll have lots of fun!

21:40.872 --> 21:46.172
Will there ever be a day that this place will become precious to me?

21:46.172 --> 21:49.382
Oh, my precious schoolwork!

21:58.252 --> 22:04.762
One day, I drew a picture all over a canvas,
itsu no hika canvas ni e ippai

22:04.842 --> 22:10.562
a picture of 7-colored dreams.
nanairo no yume egaita

22:11.982 --> 22:18.442
When I noticed, I was a bit more grown up.
ki ga tsukeba sukoshi otona ni natte

22:18.692 --> 22:23.742
What have I found?
nani wo mitsuketandarou

22:25.702 --> 22:32.452
In this aimless daily life,
yuka ate no nai mainichi no nakade

22:32.702 --> 22:38.382
I found something that's most important.
ichiban taisetsuna koto ni kizuita

22:39.382 --> 22:45.222
Yes, it's always all right,
donna tokidemo sousa daijoubu

22:45.222 --> 22:47.472
because you are here.
kimi ga irukara

22:47.682 --> 22:53.852
Holding these unforgettable thoughts,
wasurenai kono omoi dakishimete

22:54.352 --> 23:00.192
I will start walking the path of the halted fantasy again,
